Human Patrol Build Tent
    Events
        Time - PatrolTentTimerStart expires
    Conditions
        (All units of PatrolGroup1 are dead) Equal to False
    Actions
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in PatrolGroup1 and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Order (Picked unit) to Stop.
                        Unit - Add Wander (Neutral) to (Picked unit)
                    Else - Actions
        Set VariableSet PatrolTentPoint = ((Position of (Random unit from PatrolGroup1)) offset by (100.00, 100.00))
        Unit - Create 1 Tent (Resting) for Player 8 (Pink) at PatrolTentPoint facing Default building facing degrees
        Set VariableSet PatrolGroup1Tent = (Last created unit)
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_PatrolTentPoint)
        -------- Start timer for the time being still at the tent --------
        Countdown Timer - Start PatrolTentTimerStay as a One-shot timer that will expire in (Random real number between 180.00 and 400.00) seconds
